battalion-entity 1
id logic-guard-zone
display-name Guard Zone
description Configurable protected area that detects hostile faction contacts.
kind zone
render-style none
editor-category logic
editor-color red-50
editor-placeable yes
placement area
property security-level string public
faction army
collision-mode none
movement stationary
speed 0
destructible no
casts-shadow no
target-mode all
max-targets 8
sensor protected-area area 0 360 hostile
on-enter protected-area alert base-alarm
on-stay protected-area alert none
on-exit protected-area observe intruder-left
